flowchart LR
    O["Observe<br/>Read the situation"] --> D["Decide<br/>Pick the next action"]
    D --> A["Act<br/>Change the world"]
    A --> F["Feedback<br/>See what happened"]
    F -.->|becomes the next observation| O
    classDef observe fill:#1F6FEB,stroke:#0E2A43,color:#ffffff,stroke-width:1px
    classDef decide fill:#10243E,stroke:#0E2A43,color:#ffffff,stroke-width:1px
    classDef act fill:#B42318,stroke:#7A1A12,color:#ffffff,stroke-width:1px
    classDef feedback fill:#1F7A4D,stroke:#145536,color:#ffffff,stroke-width:1px
    class O observe
    class D decide
    class A act
    class F feedback
